x w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"386\">De MSI Cyborg 15 is een krachtige gaming laptop die geschikt is voor moderne games, studie, werk en contentcreatie. Dankzij de Intel Core i7-processor van de 12e generatie, het snelle DDR5-geheugen en de NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 videokaart geniet je van uitstekende prestaties en vloeiende gameplay.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"388\" data-end=\"414\"><strong data-start=\"388\" data-end=\"397\">Staat</strong><br data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"400\">In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"630\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"431\">Voordelen</strong><br data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"434\">⭐ Intel Core i7 processor van de 12e generatie<br data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"483\">⭐ NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 videokaart<br data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"522\">⭐ 16GB DDR5 werkgeheugen<br data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"549\">⭐ Snelle 512GB SSD-opslag<br data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"577\" data-is-only-node=\"\">⭐ Geschikt voor gaming, streaming en contentcreatie</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"1013\">📋 <strong data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"652\">Specificaties</strong><br data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"655\"><strong data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"669\">Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-12650H (12e generatie)<br data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"709\"><strong data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"717\">RAM:</strong> 16GB DDR5<br data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"730\"><strong data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"741\">Opslag:</strong> 512GB SSD<br data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"754\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"774\">Grafische kaart:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060<br data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"801\"><strong data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"819\">Videogeheugen:</strong> 8GB GDDR6<br data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"832\"><strong data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"843\">Scherm:</strong> 15.6 inch Full HD, 144Hz<br data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"871\"><strong data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"893\">Besturingssysteem:</strong> Windows 11<br data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"907\"><strong data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"926\">Connectiviteit:</strong> WiFi 6, Bluetooth, USB-A, USB-C, HDMI<br data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"967\"><strong data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"977\">Kleur:</strong> Zwart<br data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"986\"><strong data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"996\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1397\">📋 <strong data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1048\">Gameprestaties (schatting)</strong><br data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1051\"><strong data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1064\">Fortnite:</strong> ± 180–240 FPS (1080p, High settings)<br data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1104\"><strong data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1116\">Warzone:</strong> ± 100–140 FPS (1080p, High settings)<br data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1156\"><strong data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1166\">GTA V:</strong> ± 140–180 FPS (1080p, Very High settings)<br data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1211\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1225\">Minecraft:</strong> ± 400+ FPS (1080p, standaard instellingen)<br data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1271\"><strong data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1290\">Cyberpunk 2077:</strong> ± 70–90 FPS (1080p, High settings, DLSS ingeschakeld)<br data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1347\"><strong data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1360\">EA FC 25:</strong> ± 200+ FPS (1080p, Ultra settings)</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1458\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1417\">Meegeleverd</strong><br data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1420\">MSI Cyborg 15 A12VF-1072NL<br data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1449\">Oplader</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1519\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1482\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1485\">Incl. Garantie: 3 maanden garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
